@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/tasks

### Create a task
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Finish backend assignment",
  "description": "Build the REST API for the To-Do app",
  "dueDate": "2026-08-25"
}

### Get all tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}

### Get all completed tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}?completed=true

### Get a single task (replace :id with a real ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/6512f1a2c3b4d5e6f7890123

### Update a task (PATCH — partial update)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/6512f1a2c3b4d5e6f7890123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isCompleted": true
}

### Update a task (PUT — full update)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/6512f1a2c3b4d5e6f7890123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Finish backend assignment (updated)",
  "description": "Build and test the REST API",
  "isCompleted": true,
  "dueDate": "2026-08-26"
}

### Delete a task
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/6512f1a2c3b4d5e6f7890123

### Trigger a 400 (missing title)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "This should fail validation"
}

### Trigger a 404 (non-existent ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/000000000000000000000000